 report that the ECB was unlikely to consider \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  before the euro reaches $1.35.   \par \par \uc2 "The dollar slipped on positive news coming out of Europe, which was juxtaposed with U.S. financial concerns," said Toshihiro Azuma, a manager at Sumitomo Trust and Banking.   \par \par \uc2 The euro was traded at $1.2401/06 at 0611 GMT, just below the record peak of $1.2423 hit on Wednesday. It was the 12th record high of the past 14 trading sessions for the euro, which has surged almost 19 percent this year.   \par \par \uc2 Against the yen, the dollar was around 107.55 yen, little changed on the day.   \par \par \uc2 Sterling remained firm, holding at around $1.7670, but below Wednesday's 11-year high of $1.7700.   \par \par \uc2 Dealers also said that Tuesday's weaker-than-expected consumer prices still weighed on the dollar, as the data suggested that inflation is quite tame and as a result U.S. interest rates would stay at their currently low level for some time.   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  FUND   \par \par \uc2 Amid quiet year-end trade, market participants were awaiting news about \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  fund.   \par \par \uc2 Zembei Mizoguchi, vice finance minister for international affairs, said on Thursday that the government had not yet decided whether to raise the borrowing limit for funds for its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 The move is widely expected so that the government can facilitate more yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 Government sources have told Reuters that \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  would raise the borrowing limit on its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  account to 100 trillion yen ($931.2 billion) for the fiscal year ending next March from the current ceiling of 79 trillion yen.   \par \par \uc2 The government will push through an extra budget for the year to allow the increase in funds, the sources said. ($1=107.38 yen).    \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020031218dzci001ua\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
